      "detail": "The 12 printed lodging months sum to 2,656,588 for 2014 and 2,816,987 for 2015, but the adjacent printed annual totals are 2,749,577 and 2,905,204. The discrepancies are -92,989 and -88,217. Both reports reproduce the 2015 monthly cells and total. The output preserves the printed monthly cells and does not force them to balance."
